  "created": "2026-11-23T08:53:46.797Z",
  "description": "An update to Component factory's krypton toolkit to support .NET Framework 4.7.2 - 4.8.1 and .NET 10 - 12. Optional extra builtin Krypton palettes (Visual Studio, Material, macOS, Office 2013, Sparkle dark/light, gray/lime/accessibility, Materialize, and more). Auto-discovered by KryptonManager when this assembly is present; core Office and Sparkle Blue/Orange/Purple themes stay in Krypton.Toolkit. This package supports all .NET Framework versions starting .NET Framework 4.6.2 - 4.8.1 and .NET 10 - 12. Also, all libraries are included targeting each specific framework version for performance purposes. To view all of the standard toolkit package latest version information, please visit: https://github.com/Krypton-Suite/Krypton-Toolkit-Suite-Version-Dashboard/blob/main/Documents/Modules/Standard/Krypton-Toolkit-Suite-Standard-Modules.md",
